# Power cut during a position save (run 1 of 2, see powercut.cmake).
# Read 3 pages and let the position save complete; read 3 more pages, then cut the power in the
# middle of the 2nd flash program/erase of the next save.
@3s      tap   116dp 160dp        # "阅读" on home
+2500ms  tap   50% 228dp          # 测试长书
+3s      key   next
+1500ms  key   next
+1500ms  key   next
+12s     note  first-save-done    # saved after 8 s idle
+500ms   key   next
+1500ms  key   next
+1500ms  key   next
+200ms   powercut write 2
+20s     end                      # not reached: the cut stops the device
